      "content": "The score is getting better, but the QC tool is still stalling it. It’s being really pedantic about the \"information density per section.\" It wants more \"structural granularity\"—basically it wants to see way more distinct headers and very specific, small sub-sections.\n\nI know it sounds like a pain, but we really need to get this through the automated gate so I don't have to do a manual override. Can you try to restructure this into even more detailed sub-sections? Use more headings and break everything down into many small, bite-sized bulleted points. Just please make sure the info is still technically correct and doesn't become a total mess/nonsense.",
